/Title (Title sponsors get the largest logo placement on the car, top billing on all team materials, and featured recognition at every race, presentation, and outreach event we attend. Our race vehicle will be named after you, thus your brand rides with us across the hundreds of laps at the Formula Sun Grand Prix and the hundreds of miles of the American Solar Challenge route, allowing your brand to reach thousands of students, engineers, and industry contacts. We reserve this tier for one sponsor each season.)
